From 86de4f971b29a65751cd6d1f5d199c7f15725d6f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 5 Jun 2026 05:53:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Build complete EthixLabs app: Provider state, all 25
 missions, simulation engine, assessment

- Add provider + shared_preferences + http to pubspec.yaml
- AppProvider (ChangeNotifier): full state management with persistence via SharedPreferences
  - Mission progress tracking (stage completion, stars, flags)
  - Gamification: keys, chests, badges, heroes with milestone logic
  - Pre-test and post-test score persistence
- SimulationEngine: offline regex-based payload evaluation for all mission types
  (SQLi tautology/UNION/blind, XSS stored/reflected, IDOR, forced browsing,
   privilege escalation, workflow bypass, missing function control, default creds,
   session token exposure, lockout, verbose errors, file exposure, crypto failures,
   prompt injection, chained attacks)
- MissionsData: complete content for all 25 missions (learn/observe/test/identify/analyze/apply)
- MissionDetailScreen: generic mission overview with 6-stage cards, START MISSION button,
  sequential stage gating, completion status
- Stage screens (StageScaffold + 6 stages):
  - LearnStage: rich markdown-style content display
  - ObserveStage: checklist-based observation with VulnShop banner
  - TestStage: always-visible step-by-step guidance + VulnShop simulation panel + payload input
  - IdentifyStage: multiple-choice vulnerability identification with star award
  - AnalyzeStage: impact assessment with CVSS highlighting
  - ApplyStage: remediation selection with star award + MissionComplete dialog
- PretestScreen: 10-question assessment awarding Key #5 + Chest #5
- PosttestScreen: 20-question final assessment, 80%+ awards Keys #6/#7 + certificate
- Dashboard redesign: profile card with hero avatar, mission progress bar with tier stats,
  achievements collection (keys/flags/badges/stars with counts), roadmap preview,
  pre-test and post-test access cards
- MainLayout: expose switchTab() for dashboard roadmap navigation
- workflow.dart: save user profile to AppProvider on onboarding completion
- main.dart: bootstrap AppProvider, skip onboarding if user already set up

