+2. Time-Based Blind:
+   • Use sleep() or WAITFOR DELAY to infer true/false
+   • /products?id=1; IF (1=1) WAITFOR DELAY '0:0:5'--
+   • If the page takes 5 seconds → true condition confirmed
+
